<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n9039" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄνιππος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without horse, not serving
				on horseback,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱππόται καὶ ἄνιπποι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.215
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				899
			</span></i>; <i>without a horse to ride on,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				125
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				10.40.10
			</span></i>; <i>unable to ride,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.100a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of countries,
				<i>unsuited for horses,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄ. καὶ ἀναμάξευτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					2.108
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Aen.Tact.
				8.4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				2.13
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
